# 🛒 Customer Churn Prediction

## 📌 Overview
This project analyzes customer data to identify patterns behind customer churn and builds a model to predict which customers are likely to leave. The goal is to help businesses take proactive steps to retain at-risk customers.

## 🎯 Objective
- Identify key factors driving customer churn
- Perform exploratory data analysis (EDA) to uncover trends
- Build a predictive model to flag high-risk customers
- Provide actionable recommendations to reduce churn

## 🛠️ Tools & Libraries
Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Plotly, Scikit-learn
